{"title": "Dwarf's Poem", "pageid": 12226, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dwarf's_Poem", "categories": ["Notes", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Note_T_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Book_Note_T_Faded.png/300px-Book_Note_T_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/a/a5/Book_Note_T_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Dwarf's Poem image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Book_Note_T_Faded.png/300px-Book_Note_T_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Book_Note_T_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A eulogy for a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/20px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/30px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/40px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Selûnite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/20px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûnite</a> who died in the dark below. Notes about a door under the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">temple</a> are written in the margins.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/38px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/50px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Notes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\">Notes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Brian\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brian\" title=\"Brian\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/25px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/38px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/50px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Brian\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/25px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Brian\" title=\"Brian\">Brian</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 100 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  100  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-7bd0afca3ccafa23END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-288c2f05f21515f9END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_GOB_DwarfsPoem</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_GOB_DwarfsPoem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_GOB_DwarfsPoem\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">0271f69c-ef7f-4246-9286-41036fd2e235</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0271f69c-ef7f-4246-9286-41036fd2e235\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0271f69c-ef7f-4246-9286-41036fd2e235\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Klagga\" title=\"Klagga\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png/25px-Portrait_Klagga.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png/38px-Portrait_Klagga.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png/50px-Portrait_Klagga.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Klagga\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png/25px-Portrait_Klagga.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Klagga\" title=\"Klagga\">Klagga</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Once read, the journal entry '<a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_Nightsong\" title=\"Find the Nightsong\">Find the Nightsong</a>' is updated to say: 'Open the Door. We discovered a clue about the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aylin\" title=\"Aylin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/25px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/38px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/50px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nightsong\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png/25px-Portrait_Aylin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Portrait_Aylin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aylin\" title=\"Aylin\">Nightsong</a>: a poem about Selûne that mentions a door under the temple. What is hidden beneath the <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a>?</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>A son of Selûne fell here in the dark below,\n</p><p><br>\nAnd we sealed his grave in her holy glow\n</p><p><br>\nMay the full moon never touch the stars once more,\n</p><p><br>\nMay darkness never conquer the <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Moonmaiden's</a> door\n</p><p><br>\n[A note is scrawled in the margins: 'Found the door under the temple. Think the moon turns, but which way?' A cluster of stars and lunar phases are sketched beneath.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202700\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2411/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33917/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9192/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 5/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 972120/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.826      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   48.826      1 -total\n 56.38%   27.526     10 Template:Icon_text\n 48.58%   23.718     23 Template:Trim\n 19.90%    9.718      2 Template:Uid\n 19.87%    9.703      5 Template:Icon_link\n 13.92%    6.796      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.21%    6.451      3 Template:CharLink\n 11.60%    5.662      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.09%    4.926      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12226-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202700 and revision id 365526. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}